OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will stay
OL,6,Flargely dry overnight. There will be
OL,7,Fclear spells. However, fog and frost
OL,8,Fare likely to re-form in the east,
OL,9,Fwhilst it turns cloudy and breezy
OL,10,Ffurther west, with patchy light rain
OL,11,Fpossible.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FFog and frost should clear
OL,14,Freadily in the east on Monday, leaving
OL,15,Fbright spells. However, expect a
OL,16,Fstrengthening easterly breeze, and
OL,17,Fpatchy rain could develop in the far
OL,18,Fwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
