OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith rain at times on Tuesday,
OL,7,Faccompanied by a southeasterly breeze.
OL,8,FFurther rain on Wednesday and for a
OL,9,Fwhile on Thursday, before turning
OL,10,Fclearer and colder later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
